OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen brings travel
OL,4,Adisruption and leaves homes without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FA yellow warning for wind was in place
OL,8,Funtil 21:00 in Wales, with the Met
OL,9,FOffice warning there could be power
OL,10,Fcuts, large waves on the coast and
OL,11,Ftravel delays. A separate warning ended
OL,12,Fat 17:00.
